<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>
        My name is <strong>Zongjie Li</strong> (李宗杰 / 李宗傑 / Lee Chung Kit). I am a final-year Ph.D. student in Computer Science at
        <a href="https://hkust.edu.hk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST)</a>,
        advised by Prof. <a href="https://www.cse.ust.hk/~shuaiw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shuai Wang</a>.
        Currently, I am visiting the <a href="https://ast.ethz.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Advanced Software Technologies (AST) Lab</a> at
        <a href="https://ethz.ch/en.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ETH Zurich</a>, advised by Prof. <a href="https://people.inf.ethz.ch/suz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zhendong Su</a>.
        Prior to my Ph.D., I obtained my B.S. in Computer Science from Harbin Institute of Technology, Shenzhen.
      </p>
      <p>My research interests lie in <strong>Large Language Models for Code</strong>, software security, and AI safety.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

